# ~/.config/pacman/pkglist.txt -- managed by chezmoi
# Source: private_dot_config/pacman/pkglist.txt.tmpl  (edit the .tmpl, not the target)
#
# Reference manifest for CachyOS / Arch hosts. paru resolves official repo names
# first and falls back to the AUR automatically, so a single list covers both.
#
# Install missing packages by hand with:
#     grep -Ev '^\s*(#|$)' ~/.config/pacman/pkglist.txt | paru -S --needed -
# or let the tag-gated chezmoi script
# (.chezmoiscripts/run_onchange_after_10-pacman-install.sh) do it for you.

